WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.960
The problem with traditional dentistry.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:04.460
Most dental visits follow the same pattern.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.660
You come in, someone counts your gums, looks
for cavities, maybe takes

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.120
some x -rays, then you leave.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.080
The problem is that many of the most
important health issues don't begin as

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.180
cavities. They begin much earlier.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:22.300
Many people are living with poor sleep,
airway issues, chronic inflammation,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:27.020
grinding, jaw dysfunction, oral bacterial
imbalances,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.520
and early signs of systemic disease.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.780
Unfortunately, these issues often go
unnoticed for years, and the result,

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.300
people spend years treating symptoms without
understanding the root cause.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:39.540
That's where the Forma Method is different.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.540
Introducing the Forma Method.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.080
The Forma Method is a comprehensive health
evaluation that uses your mouth

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:50.700
as a window into your overall health, sleep,
inflammation, and longevity.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.560
Instead of looking at one tooth at a time,
we look at the complete picture.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.640
We ask, why is this happening?

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:57.960
What caused this?

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.280
What can we learn from it?

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:01.120
And how can we help prevent the problems?

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:03.200
The goal is not simply healthier teeth.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.700
The goal is a healthier you.